    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"EditaPublishedForm-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> It's possible that a published form may need to be edited again. This function enables implementer to edit a published form.</span></p><h2 id=\"EditaPublishedForm-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"EditaPublishedForm-1.GotoFormBuilder\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Goto Form Builder</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Click on the <em>eye icon</em> of the form which you need to edit.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-44-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488465847898&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=176\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-44-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488465847898&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115126735\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-2_22-44-5.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085335\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"11\" data-media-id=\"dd41f61d-7260-484f-9e14-7b0dd9ad41fc\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-44-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488465847898&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=352 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-44-5.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488465847898&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=176 1x\"></span><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Form builder dashboard</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><h3 id=\"EditaPublishedForm-2.EditthePublishedForm\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Edit the Published Form</span></h3><p>Click the<em> Edit </em>button and confirm to enter into the edit mode.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c0a9edd0-eeea-4944-8e25-ffb795a912a3\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">New version of form will be created</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><ul><li>After the entered the edit mode, once the form is saved, a new version of the form will be created automatically whether the content of the form is changed or not.</li><li>The status of this saved form is <em>draft</em> since it is not published yet.</li><li><span>When the status of form is draft, the version and status won't change if the form is repeatedly saved.</span></li></ul></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-53-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488466419574&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=322\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-53-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488466419574&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115126853\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-2_22-53-29.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085335\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"11\" data-media-id=\"8281a0ef-30e0-41e1-802a-0676de9f31b5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-53-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488466419574&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=644 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_22-53-29.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488466419574&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=322 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Confirm to go to edit mode</strong></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_23-8-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488467329256&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/115085335/image2017-3-2_23-8-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488467329256&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115127055\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2017-3-2_23-8-45.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"115085335\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"11\" data-media-id=\"54cf0037-e1f2-46f1-b880-d2b3b318a787\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_23-8-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488467329256&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=738 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/115085335/image2017-3-2_23-8-45.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1488467329256&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Save form</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"EditaPublishedForm-3.PublishtheForm\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Publish the Form</span></h3><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"a50a5b8a-5d5b-4c4e-8aff-e3ef909db976\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><p class=\"title\">Publish the form</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>If want to apply this form in Bahmni immediately, remember to publish it.</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"0b744f92-0474-4511-ba50-ea4dc8343d16\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4084f2de-c0c2-4eeb-b02a-1184ccf78a4a\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085179/Create+a+new+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085179\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Create a new Form</a></p><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085295/Add+Controls\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085295\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Add Controls</a></p><p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115085378/Rename+a+Form\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115085378\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Rename a Form</a></p>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
